{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/28efeb29f6bf3d152daec560a0d4417e.avif?t=1761184809\" width=1560 height=800 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some heroes happen by accident.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride Professor Raventhorpe\u2019s <strong>Anytime Elevator</strong>, where <strong>every floor is a year</strong> <strong>in history</strong>\u00a0in a cinematic 2.5D single-player puzzle platformer from a <i>former Disney ride designer</i>. <strong>Great on Steam Deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ari Buktu pops into Professor Raventhorpe\u2019s lab for extra credit and gets launched through history to steal a <strong>mystical tiara</strong> and fix the professor\u2019s love life. <strong>\u201cSo... we\u2019re treasure hunters now?\u201d</strong> Each stop brings a new era, a bigger temple puzzle, and a rival tomb raider on your heels.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184020?t=1761184809","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761184809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/3c80cbc8c31b4a8c353613cc111107ccfe7a3ae6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761184809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/3c80cbc8c31b4a8c353613cc111107ccfe7a3ae6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761184809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3191270,"description":""}],"